      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} Currently this system is not ready for use the way it is implemented now. It doesnt just sound different, but the audio doesnt give proper sound levels in the right sound canal to indicate where the source of the audio is. Sounds to the left should also have sound on the right as your right ear also picks up the sound, but right now it is not giving the right levels. This needs much further testing before it can be properly implemented. So yes it IS currently a bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
